	<description><![CDATA[India’s central bank announced measures to ease pressure on the rupee, including supplying dollars directly to three state-run oil companies and tightening rules on currency derivatives. The steps aim to reduce foreign-exchange market demand and volatility as the rupee trades near its record low.]]></description>
	
